🎯 Interview Question 4

“How do you structure the AI response so that it can be easily displayed in your React UI?”

Answer this based on your actual code, especially:

responseMimeType: 'application/json'
JSON.parse()
finalPlan
validateProjectPlan()
setPlan(data.plan)
